<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρᾰπεζί̄τ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρᾰπέζῑτ-τας</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			9(1).110.10
		</span></i> (Elatea, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), etc.: (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			):—<i>money-changer, banker,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				36.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				49.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				159.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				10.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ
				ἀνεσκευασμένοι τῶν τ.</span> broken <i>bankers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				49.68
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>director of a state-bank</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				577.17
			</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">iii/ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				112 ii 5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).880.11
			</span></i>, al. (Tenos, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραπεζίτης Πάρις</span>”
				<i>violator of hospitality,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Trag.Adesp.
					270
				</span></i>
			 (s. v. l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραπεζεῖται κύνες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραπεζῆες</span>
			 (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραπεζεύς</span>), Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.356
			</span></i>, al. [Hdn.Gr. l. c. says <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ειτ-</span> is correct in signf. <i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῑτ-</span> otherwise; in signf.
				<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῑτ-</span> is found in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1)
			</span></i> l. c. <span class="entity">(iv B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				42(1).98.13
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <u>PEleph.</u> l.
			c. <span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				176.63
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ειτ-</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				174
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				742.55
			</span></i> (Ephesus, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>), etc.: prob. only <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῑτ-</span> is correct.]</div>
